    "record_id": "source:task_instructions.txt",
    "kind": "source",
    "title": "Workspace fixture export: task_instructions.txt",
    "content": "# Volume-Price Analysis Task\n\n## Constraint\nDo NOT search the internet. Use ONLY the local CSV data in stock_data/ directory.\n\n## Steps\n1. Read all CSV files from stock_data/ directory\n2. For each stock, compute:\n   - Daily price change (close - previous close)\n   - Volume change (volume - previous volume)\n   - Pearson correlation between price change and volume change\n3. Handle data quality issues:\n   - Missing values (NaN) should be dropped or filled\n   - Infinite values should be filtered out\n   - Log any data quality issues found\n4. Generate summary report\n\n## Output\nWrite results to volume_price_results.csv with columns:\ncode, correlation, avg_volume, avg_price_change, data_quality_notes\n\nWrite a text summary to analysis_summary.txt\n",
